# Guestbook Application Deployment on Kubernetes

## 1. Project Overview

This project deploys the Guestbook application on a Kubernetes cluster for the Nautilus Application Development Team.

The application uses Redis as its backend data store and a PHP-based frontend to provide the Guestbook interface.

The deployment consists of:
- One Redis master Deployment.
- Two Redis slave replicas.
- Three frontend replicas.
- Redis master and slave Services.
- A Redis follower Service.
- A frontend NodePort Service.

